            <h2 class="pipe">Commercial Asphalt Paving, Excavation & Hardscaping in Northborough, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> provides high-ticket commercial asphalt paving, site excavation, and <a href="/worcester-county/hardscape-contractor-northborough-ma">masonry construction</a> for commercial plazas and residential subdivisions in <strong>Northborough, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in central Worcester County along major logistics corridors, Northborough soils vary from dense clay to glacial till. Winter freeze-thaw cycles cause rapid ground expansion, which damages unreinforced pavements and masonry structures under heavy traffic loads. S. Phaneuf & Associates overcomes these geotechnical challenges through precision subgrade compaction, installing catch basin drainage systems, and paving with MassDOT-certified asphalt.</p>
        </section>

