            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: What is involved in commercial site excavation in Northborough, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates executes commercial site excavation by clearing trees and vegetation, stripping topsoil, and grading site subsoils using laser-guided bulldozers. Crews dig foundation trenches, install underground drainage structures and catch basins, and lay a 8-to-12 inch compacted gravel sub-base designed to support heavy commercial traffic and delivery vehicles in Northborough.</p>

            <h3 class="fw-0 pt-3">Q: How often should a commercial asphalt parking lot be sealcoated in Northborough, MA?</h3>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates recommends commercial parking lots in Northborough be sealcoated every 2 to 3 years. Sealcoating applies a protective coal-tar or asphalt emulsion layer that seals porous asphalt against chemical spills, UV oxidation, and water penetration, extending pavement service life and maintaining clean curb appeal.</p>
